ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 708 Td
(In one sentence) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 683 Td
(  MaxxLoop turns a short focus/energy/stress check-in into an explanation, one small) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 670 Td
(  suggested action, and a follow-up record that can inform future suggestions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 652 Td
(30-second explanation) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 627 Td
(  Students and knowledge workers can notice that they feel overloaded without) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 614 Td
(  knowing what small step to take next or whether it helped. MaxxLoop compares a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 601 Td
(  user's check-in with available recent signals, explains the main contributors,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 588 Td
(  offers one action from a curated library, and asks for another check-in. Feedback) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 575 Td
(  is saved so later recommendations can adapt. It is a wellness/productivity) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 562 Td
(  prototype, not a medical device or clinical diagnosis system.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 544 Td
(One-minute explanation) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 519 Td
(  MaxxLoop is designed around a personal learning loop: Track, Understand, Act,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 506 Td
(  Measure, Improve. A person reports focus, energy, and stress on a short check-in.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 493 Td
(  The API combines those values with available activity signals and historical) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 480 Td
(  baselines to compute a bounded capacity estimate. It identifies contributors,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 467 Td
(  applies drop/cooldown rules, and may recommend one action. After the action) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 454 Td
(  window, the user can report their state again and whether the action felt helpful.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 441 Td
(  The system records the before/after difference, an estimated no-action drift, and) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 428 Td
(  feedback. A statistical recommender uses prior outcomes to adjust which actions it) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 415 Td
(  samples. These are self-report measurements and estimates; they do not establish) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 402 Td
(  medical status or causal effectiveness.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 384 Td
(Technical explanation) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 359 Td
(  The web client is Next.js App Router with React and TypeScript. It calls a FastAPI) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 346 Td
(  API using credentialed HTTP requests and a session cookie. MongoDB stores) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 333 Td
(  account/session records; SQLModel persists product records in the configured) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 320 Td
(  relational database \(SQLite by default\). The API's baseline, capacity, driver,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 307 Td
(  drop-detection, recommender, and measurement modules implement) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 294 Td
(  deterministic/statistical logic. Explanation text defaults to a template provider,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 281 Td
(  with optional Gemini, Ollama, and OpenAI-compatible providers. See [Architecture],) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 268 Td
(  [Recommender], and [API].) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 250 Td
(Problem and core idea) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 225 Td
(  The product addresses a product-design gap: self-tracking can produce information) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 212 Td
(  without an immediate next step, generic advice may not fit the moment, and users) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 199 Td
(  may not record whether an action helped them. MaxxLoop connects these stages in) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 186 Td
(  one repeatable flow. This is the project's intended value proposition, not a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 173 Td
(  market-wide claim that competitors lack these features.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 155 Td
(Audience and output) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 130 Td
(  Initial intended users are students and knowledge workers who want lightweight) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 117 Td
(  focus/recovery support. Each loop can produce a capacity estimate, signal-driver) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 104 Td
(  labels, an offered action, a measured outcome, and a helpfulness response.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 91 Td
(  Insights summarize records already present for the signed-in user.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 73 Td
(What the system learns) Tj
ET
