BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 342 Td
(What it is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 317 Td
(  The recommender is a statistical selection mechanism over a curated JSON action) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 304 Td
(  library. It is not a trained neural network or general-purpose AI model. The) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 291 Td
(  language provider creates explanatory text and is separate from action selection.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 273 Td
(Inputs and candidate filtering) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 248 Td
(  The engine receives the user ID and top driver kinds from the capacity/check-in) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 235 Td
(  path. It loads apps/api/app/data/actions.json \(24 action records in the current) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 222 Td
(  file\). Candidate actions are those whose target_drivers overlap active drivers. If) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 209 Td
(  no overlap exists, it falls back to selected general restorative categories.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 191 Td
(Selection) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 166 Td
(  Each \(user_id, action_id\) has an ActionPrior with alpha and beta. A new prior is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 153 Td
(  initialized from action prior_effect using total strength 4: alpha = effect x 4,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 140 Td
(  beta = \(1-effect\) x 4. The engine samples theta ~ Beta\(alpha,beta\) per candidate) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 127 Td
(  and usually selects the highest draw. With default probability 0.15 it chooses a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 114 Td
(  random candidate as exploration when there is more than one. This is Thompson-) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 101 Td
(  sampling-style selection with an explicit exploration branch.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 83 Td
(Outcome update) Tj
ET
