/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 530 Td
(1. MaxxLoop in one sentence) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 505 Td
(  MaxxLoop helps students and knowledge workers notice when their focus and energy) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 492 Td
(  are slipping, choose one small recovery action, and check whether it helped them) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 479 Td
(  personally.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 461 Td
(  The product loop is Track -> Understand -> Act -> Measure -> Improve. The main) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 448 Td
(  idea is to make a wellness check-in lead to a useful next step and a follow-up) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 435 Td
(  measurement, instead of stopping at a chart or a generic list of advice.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 417 Td
(30-second pitch) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 394 Td
(  "Students and knowledge workers often realize they are overloaded only after their) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 381 Td
(  focus has already dropped. Most tools show historical charts or offer generic) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 368 Td
(  tips. MaxxLoop uses lightweight self-reported signals to estimate a person's) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 355 Td
(  current capacity against their own recent baseline. It explains the main) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 342 Td
(  contributors, suggests one small action, and asks for a follow-up check-in to) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 329 Td
(  learn what seems helpful for that person. It is a wellness-support prototype, not) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 316 Td
(  a medical device or a substitute for professional care.") Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 298 Td
(2. Problem, users, and solution) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 273 Td
(The problem) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 250 Td
(  People have limited attention and energy, especially during study or demanding) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 237 Td
(  work. A dashboard may show a low score without telling someone what to do next. A) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 224 Td
(  long list of wellness tips can also make a tired person choose among too many) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 211 Td
(  options. There is room for a simple experience that connects a check-in, an) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 198 Td
(  understandable explanation, one action, and a follow-up.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 180 Td
(Who it is for) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 157 Td
(  The initial audience is students and knowledge workers who want lightweight) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 144 Td
(  support for focus and recovery. The current product does not diagnose burnout,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 131 Td
(  anxiety, depression, ADHD, or any other condition.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 113 Td
(What the app does today) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 90 Td
(  1. The user signs in and completes a short check-in for focus, energy, and stress,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 77 Td
(  with an optional note.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 64 Td
(  2. The API compares recent signals with the user's available baseline and) Tj
