/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 585 Td
(7. The doctor / clinical part) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 560 Td
(  There is no doctor or clinician built into the current product, and no clinical) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 547 Td
(  review or validation is established by the current project materials. MaxxLoop is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 534 Td
(  a non-medical focus and wellness-support prototype. It does not diagnose, treat,) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 521 Td
(  prescribe, or replace a clinician.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 503 Td
(  The responsible answer to "What does the doctor do?" is:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 485 Td
(  "A doctor is not part of the current product, and we are not presenting this as) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 472 Td
(  medical care. The current safety behavior is a limited phrase-based interruption) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 459 Td
(  that displays support resources. Before using this with real users at scale, we) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 446 Td
(  would want qualified mental-health professionals to review the language, low-risk) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 433 Td
(  action library, escalation flow, and evaluation plan.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 415 Td
(  If someone may be in immediate danger, direct them to local emergency services or) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 402 Td
(  a trusted person. For India, the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare lists Tele-) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 389 Td
(  MANAS at 14416 and 1-800-891-4416. Confirm current availability and local) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 376 Td
(  resources before presenting them as live support. [National Mental Health) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 363 Td
(  Programme / Tele-MANAS]) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 345 Td
(  Do not say keyword detection is reliable, that it prevents suicide, or that the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 332 Td
(  app monitors a user continuously.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 314 Td
(8. Live demo walkthrough) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 289 Td
(  Run the app from the repository configuration and verify both services are healthy) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 276 Td
(  before presenting. Use your actual configured frontend/API URLs; do not hard-code) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 263 Td
(  a port in a slide unless you checked it on that machine.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 245 Td
(  Recommended route sequence:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 227 Td
(  1. Home \(/\) - explain the user problem and the single-loop promise.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 214 Td
(  2. Sign in / sign up - show the account boundary only with a demo account; never) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 201 Td
(  put real credentials on screen.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 188 Td
(  3. Dashboard - complete Focus, Energy, and Stress check-in. Explain the score and) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 175 Td
(  drivers as estimates.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 162 Td
(  4. Recommendation - explain why one action was selected. Start or skip it.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 149 Td
(  5. Measurement - complete the follow-up and helpfulness feedback. Point out the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 136 Td
(  observed change and explain the no-action estimate cautiously.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 123 Td
(  6. History / Insights \(/history, /insights\) - show that the loop was recorded and) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 110 Td
(  how prior user feedback informs later choices.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 97 Td
(  7. Privacy \(/privacy\) - describe the controls and actual storage split honestly.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 84 Td
(  8. Demo \(/demo\) - optional: use seeded personas and time controls to make a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
62 71 Td
(  repeatable short presentation. Clearly say the personas are demo data.) Tj
ET
