BT
/F1 8 Tf
0.35 0.38 0.43 rg
538 24 Td
(Page 26) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 738 Td
(  The other available pages include /onboarding, /profile, /login, and /signup.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 725 Td
(  Avoid relying on exact score, action, confidence interval, or net-effect numbers:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 712 Td
(  these may vary with data and state.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 694 Td
(90-second spoken demo) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 671 Td
(  "MaxxLoop starts with a quick check-in about focus, energy, and stress. It) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 658 Td
(  compares that check-in with the user's recent pattern and explains the main) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 645 Td
(  contributors. Instead of handing an overloaded user a long list, it offers one) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 632 Td
(  small action. The user can try it, check in again, and say whether it felt) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 619 Td
(  helpful. That response becomes part of the user's recommendation history. The) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 606 Td
(  score and measured change are product estimates, not clinical measurements or) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 593 Td
(  proof of causality. This demo persona is seeded data; we still need real-world) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.24 0.30 0.36 rg
62 580 Td
(  evaluation to assess impact.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 562 Td
(  Then complete one actual loop on screen. If a stage fails, narrate the failure) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 549 Td
(  honestly and use the demo console only if the issue is clearly due to live) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 536 Td
(  data/setup; do not claim a successful live action that did not complete.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 518 Td
(9. Likely judge questions and good answers) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 493 Td
(  "Is this a medical app?") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 480 Td
(  "No. It is a non-medical wellness and focus-support prototype. It does not) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 467 Td
(  diagnose or treat conditions. Its capacity score is an estimate, and its safety) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 454 Td
(  phrase matching is limited.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 436 Td
(  "What is AI about it?") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 423 Td
(  "The recommendation layer personalizes from recorded feedback using a lightweight) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 410 Td
(  Thompson-sampling approach. The default text layer is deterministic templates. We) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 397 Td
(  do not need to pretend a generative model is making the core score or that one is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 384 Td
(  active in this demo.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 366 Td
(  "How do you know the action worked?") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 353 Td
(  "We collect a self-reported before/after check-in and compare it with an estimated) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 340 Td
(  no-action drift based on prior windows. It helps us track observed response, but) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 327 Td
(  it is not randomized evidence or proof of causation.") Tj
ET
