ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 601 Td
(  Answer: Self-tracking can show a state without a next step, while generic advice) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 588 Td
(  may not fit the user's context. We connect a check-in to one action and a later) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 575 Td
(  record.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.03 0.32 0.28
54 557 Td
