/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 230 Td
(  mapped to a bounded 0-100 product score. It is not a clinical measurement.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 217 Td
