BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 168 Td
(  Answer: The baseline engine uses configured population priors/fallback blending) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.10 0.12 0.16 rg
54 155 Td
(  when personal history is sparse, then can use more personal history as it) Tj
